[7810]={o="Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.",d="There must be more to being a master of the arena than this!   Perhaps the Pirate who runs the event at Gurubashi will know!",c="Arr Me Hearty! Gaining one Trinket be not enough to make ye master of the Arena! Now tis the time to truly prove your steel.",k=true},
