[8710]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Ornate Hilt, 2  Onyx Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus.  You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",n={{"Onyx Idol",2},{"Gold Scarab",5},{"Clay Scarab",5}},d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.\n\nJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, <name>, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",p="Did you bring me the components I require, <name>?",c="You've done well, <class>. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.\n\nTake your weapon, <name>. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!",r={it={{21416,1,"Kris of Unspoken Names",4,"inv_weapon_shortblade_27"}}},k=true},
[8711]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2  Amber Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus.  You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",n={{"Amber Idol",2},{"Bronze Scarab",5},{"Ivory Scarab",5}},d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.\n\nJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, <name>, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",p="Did you bring me the components I require, <name>?",c="You've done well, <class>. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.\n\nTake your weapon, <name>. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!",r={it={{21395,1,"Blade of Eternal Justice",4,"inv_sword_57"}}},k=true},
[8712]={o="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus.  You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",n={{"Azure Idol",2},{"Silver Scarab",5},{"Bone Scarab",5}},d="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.\n\nJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, <name>, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",p="Did you bring me the components I require, <name>?",c="You've done well, <class>. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.\n\nTake your weapon, <name>. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!",r={it={{21401,1,"Scythe of the Unseen Path",4,"inv_axe_15"}}},k=true},
[8728]={o="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to bring him 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 Elementium Ore, 10 Azerothian Diamonds, and 10 Blue Sapphires.",n={{"Arcanite Bar",20},{"Elementium Ore",10},{"Azerothian Diamond",10},{"Blue Sapphire",10}},d="Well that took a little longer than expected. Now let me see what this ledger says.\n\n<Narain silently reads the ledger, periodically mumbling under his breath.>\n\nThe good news is that I am 99% certain that I am capable of creating an arcanite buoy that will function to your specifications. This is, of course, wholly dependant on the bad news.\n\nThe bad news is that I'm going to need a lot of arcanite, elementium ore, and rare gemstones.\n\nBring me what I need and I will craft the buoy.",p="Arcanite buoys don't just make themselves, <name>. And NO, you cannot borrow some money.",c="A deal is a deal. I sure hope you know what you are getting yourself into, <name>. This is an awful lot of trouble to go through to do some fishing.",r={rep={{910,250}}},k=true},
[8729]={o="Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.",d="Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit.\n\nAccording to my superior psycho-psionic clairvoyance, you'll find that the best spot to cast this buoy is off the coast of Azshara, in the Bay of Storms.\n\nLook for a swirling maelstrom, most likely cluttered with wreckage.\n\nBy the by, I hope you have friends.\n\nNow if you somehow miraculously succeed, take the scepter shard to Anachronos.",p="Time is running out, champion.",c="Well done, <name>. I will be able to reform the Scepter of the Shifting Sands soon.",r={ch={{21526,1,"Band of Icy Depths",4,"inv_jewelry_ring_35"},{21527,1,"Darkwater Robes",4,"inv_chest_cloth_31"}},rep={{910,500}}},k=true},
[8730]={o="Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task.",d="Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it... But what would tragedy be without cruelty?\n\n<Vaelastrasz coughs weakly.>\n\nNe... Nefarius now holds the scepter shard.\n\nTime is of the essence. Nefarius plans to destroy the shard. You must hurry!",p="Another of our heroes lost to the spawn of Deathwing. We will be cursed with this suffering forever...",c="Vaelastrasz's soul is at ease, champion. The Aspects all watch your progress with great interest. Know that you have powerful allies.\n\nI was commanded to grant you something to aid you in this struggle. Use it well...",r={ch={{21530,1,"Onyx Embedded Leggings",4,"inv_pants_mail_04"},{21529,1,"Amulet of Shadow Shielding",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_17"}},rep={{910,500}}},k=true},
[8733]={o="Travel to the continent of Teldrassil and find Malfurion's agent somewhere outside the walls of Darnassus.",d="This is a journey of redemption, hero. Would it be that I was slain today, I would have died for a just and righteous cause. You must recover the green scepter shard. You must cleanse Eranikus of the taint placed upon him by the Old Gods.\n\nTravel to Darnassus. Just outside the city walls you will find one of my agents. This agent will set things in motion for us and inform Tyrande of our plans without alerting Staghelm.\n\n<Malfurion sighs.>\n\nA fall from grace a thousand years in the making...",c="The wisp is silent except for a low humming sound. Oddly enough, it is able to communicate with you through thoughts.",r={rep={{910,25},{609,25}}},k=true},
[8734]={o="Travel to the Moonglade and speak to Keeper Remulos.",d="Tyrande will be notifed, mortal. Shan'do Stormrage has prepared me for this contingency.\n\nNow you must venture to the Moonglade and speak with Remulos. He will have further instruction as to the summoning of Eranikus.\n\nWe all wish you great luck.",c="It would be impossible to pull Eranikus from the Dream should he refuse. His intentions, however, require him to enter our world. He seeks to destroy the living manifestation of Malfurion. To do this successfully would mean an end to one of the most powerful allies of the Dream. The Nightmare would wholly consume all that would remain should Malfurion fall...",r={rep={{910,10},{609,150}}},k=true},
[8735]={o="Travel to the four Emerald Dream portals in Azeroth and collect a Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption from each. Return to Keeper Remulos in the Moonglade when you have completed this task.",d="You must travel to the four dream portals of Azeroth. From each you must draw a fragment of the Nightmare's corruption. The dragonkin that inhabit these areas will hold such fragments. Return to me when you have gathered these fragments.",p="<Remulos is lost deep in thought.>",c="Are you prepared? Is the world prepared for what we are about to invoke? I do not know... I am bound by duty to Malfurion. Duty and honor...",r={rep={{910,250}}},k=true},
[8736]={o="Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",d="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him.\n\nTyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction.\n\nBe on guard! You and your allies are our only hope.",c="He is redeemed, <name>. He now returns to the Dream to right what he alone has done wrong. Eranikus will be a powerful ally to Malfurion and my father.\n\nThese armaments are for you, <name>; given to me by Ysera herself. You would do well to make use of them in your battles against the Qiraji.",r={ch={{21531,1,"Drake Tooth Necklace",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_22"},{21532,1,"Drudge Boots",4,"inv_boots_08"}},rep={{910,500}}},k=true},
[8741]={o="Take the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.",d="The keeper awaits your return, <name>. Take the green scepter shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",c="Your deeds will be known to all, champion. They will sing your praises from Orgrimmar to the far reaches of the South Seas. All will know of the champion of the Bronze Flight, <name>.",r={rep={{910,250}}},k=true},
[8742]={o="A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age.\n\nThe Old God trembles, <name>. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C'Thun.\n\nIt knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you the Scepter of the Shifting Sands.",k=false},
[8743]={o="The Scarab Gong looms ominously before you. Steel yourself, <name>; for once the Scarab Gong is rung, the gates of Ahn'Qiraj will be opened.\n\nFrom the slackened maw of the beast can only come chaos and destruction. Defend your people!",k=false},
[8745]={o="Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.\n\nI have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",k=false},
[8747]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",k=false},
[8748]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",k=false},
[8749]={o="You honor my kind, <name>. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.\n\nYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",k=false},
[8750]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, <name>. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",k=false},
[8751]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",k=false},
[8752]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",k=false},
[8753]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",k=false},
[8754]={o="You honor my kind, <name>. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.\n\nYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",k=false},
[8755]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, <name>. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",k=false},
[8756]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",k=false},
[8757]={o="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",k=false},
[8758]={o="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",k=false},
[8759]={o="You honor my kind, <name>. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.\n\nYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",k=false},
[8760]={o="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, <name>. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",k=false},
[8761]={o="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",k=false},
[8791]={o="Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",d="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.\n\nThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.",p="Ah, <name>, you have returned! And in one piece, I might add. What news do you bring from Ahn'Qiraj?",c="I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, <name>. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service.",r={ch={{21504,1,"Charm of the Shifting Sands",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_03"},{21507,1,"Amulet of the Shifting Sands",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_03"},{21505,1,"Choker of the Shifting Sands",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_03"},{21506,1,"Pendant of the Shifting Sands",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_03"}},rep={{910,500},{609,350}}},k=true},
[8798]={o="Say! You know what?! You're an engineer too! So, since you helped me teach my friends a lesson, I'm going to teach you how to make your very own mechanical yeti! Now the fun can go on forever and ever, and you can scare whoever you want! Provided that you can scare up the components to make it that is.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? Do you want to learn the secret to making a mechanical yeti?",k=false},
[8800]={o="Talk to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",d="As you complete the tasks you're assigned in the war you'll want to talk to Vargus, the blacksmith.  Show him any badges you've earned along the way. He'll provide you with gear to match your level of commitment to our cause.",c="Kaldon sent you? Very well, let's see what we can do for you.",r={rep={{609,10}}},k=true},
[8801]={o="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelestrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",k=false},
[8802]={o="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",d="To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord/Lady <name>. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",p="Lord <name>! It is over...",c="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours.",r={ch={{21712,1,"Amulet of the Fallen God",4,"inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_02"},{21710,1,"Cloak of the Fallen God",4,"inv_misc_cape_10"},{21709,1,"Ring of the Fallen God",4,"inv_jewelry_ring_ahnqiraj_02"}},rep={{609,200}}},k=true},
[8905]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22108,1,"Feralheart Bracers",3,"inv_bracer_09"}}},k=true},
[8906]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Beaststalker's Bindings to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22011,1,"Beastmaster's Bindings",3,"inv_bracer_17"}}},k=true},
[8907]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Magister's Bindings to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22063,1,"Sorcerer's Bindings",3,"inv_jewelry_ring_23"}}},k=true},
[8908]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Lightforge Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22088,1,"Soulforge Bracers",3,"inv_bracer_14"}}},k=true},
[8909]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with 1 set of Devout Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22079,1,"Virtuous Bracers",3,"inv_belt_31"}}},k=true},
[8910]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Shadowcraft Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22004,1,"Darkmantle Bracers",3,"inv_bracer_07"}}},k=true},
[8911]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Dreadmist Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{22071,1,"Deathmist Bracers",3,"inv_bracer_13"}}},k=true},
[8912]={o="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bracers of Valor to Deliana in Ironforge.",n={{"Winterspring Blood Sample",15}},d="Well met, <class>.  I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.",p="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.",r={it={{21996,1,"Bracers of Heroism",3,"inv_bracer_18"}}},k=true},
[8913]={o="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",n={{"Silithus Venom Sample",15}},d="Hail, <class>!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",p="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it.",r={it={{22108,1,"Feralheart Bracers",3,"inv_bracer_09"}}},k=true},
[8914]={o="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Beaststalker's Bindings to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",n={{"Silithus Venom Sample",15}},d="Hail, <class>!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",p="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bindings were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it.",r={it={{22011,1,"Beastmaster's Bindings",3,"inv_bracer_17"}}},k=true},
